      textKey: narrative.air_corridor.debrief-aria
      englishFallback: Recovered flight data confirms that assessment. Armored columns
        are now approaching the fuel reserves. The corridor is open, but the next
        defense will be on the ground.
      speaker: 3
      voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9d69261c23bad443ea2adf0f45a0546a, type: 3}
